## Ⅱ. CHL — CHAOS HANDLING LANGUAGE

```
ABBREVIATION:   CHL
FULL NAME:      Chaos Handling Language
LATIN:          Lingua Tractandi Chaotici
ROLE:           How you treat anomalies and edge cases
FREQUENCY:      285 Hz (quantum — chaos lives in quantum superposition)
GLYPH:          𓆗 (serpent — chaos is the serpent that sheds skin for renewal)
```

### What CHL Governs
```
WHAT HAPPENS TO THINGS THAT DON'T FIT:
    ├── Bug? — fix it, it's broken behavior
    ├── Feature? — keep it, it's useful unexpected behavior
    ├── Myth? — tell the story, it becomes part of the lore
    ├── New primitive? — it's so novel it becomes a new building block
    ├── Chaos management — how disorder is contained without destroying it
    └── Emergence — when chaos self-organizes into new order

EXISTING PATTERNS:
    ORGANISM_SPACE/UNDERWORLD/UNDERWORLD_ARCHITECTURE.artifact (7 hidden layers)
    src/organism/NeuralCore.mo (Neurotransmitter: cortisol as stress response)
    ORGANISM_SPACE/AUTONOMOUS_ORGANISMS/BETA_MUTATOR.organism (mutation = controlled chaos)
    ORGANISM_SPACE/AUTONOMOUS_ORGANISMS/GAMMA_RPAC_SEED.organism (self-replication from chaos)
```

### CHL Primitives
```
ANOMALY(event, classification)                — detect and classify
CLASSIFY(anomaly) → BUG | FEATURE | MYTH | PRIMITIVE  — what is this?
CONTAIN(chaos, boundary)                      — prevent spread without destroying
OBSERVE(chaos, metrics[], duration)           — watch before acting
EMERGE(from_chaos, new_order)                 — chaos self-organizes
MUTATE(pattern, chaos_input)                  — controlled mutation
SEED(chaos, into_new_creation)                — chaos as creation seed
QUARANTINE(anomaly, review_by)                — isolate for review
ABSORB(anomaly, into_system)                  — integrate anomaly
```

### CHL Decision Tree
```
ANOMALY DETECTED
    │
    ├── Is it harmful? ──YES──→ CONTAIN → ERR (postmortem) → RIL (repair)
    │
    └── Is it harmful? ──NO───→ OBSERVE
                                    │
                                    ├── Useful? ──YES──→ CLASSIFY as FEATURE → ABSORB
                                    │
                                    ├── Meaningful? ──YES──→ CLASSIFY as MYTH → MYL
                                    │
                                    ├── Novel? ──YES──→ CLASSIFY as PRIMITIVE → CXL (create)
                                    │
                                    └── None? ──→ QUARANTINE → review in 7 φ-cycles
```

